## 3. Architecture

![Data flow: the {{ n_src }} source datasets, the processed corpus of the vn-legal project, the knowledge-graph build, the tables and RDF dumps it writes, and their uses.](figures/architecture.svg)

**Source datasets.** {{ n_src | capitalize }} datasets published on Hugging Face by `tmquan` are the data home of {{ release }}; each is at `https://huggingface.co/datasets/tmquan/<dataset>` (the names in the table are links), pinned to a fixed revision:

